<section>
	

    
		




    
    
    <div class="alert">





	<div class="alerts-details-minimum am-js__alerts-details-minimum">
	    <div class="alerts-details-minimum__container">
	       	<h1 class="alerts-details-minimum__container_title heading-1 font-regular">Gold Runner Service Adjustments</h1>
	       
	            <span class="alerts-details-minimum__container_date"> Effective October 25, 2026</span>
	       
	        <p>Due to planned infrastructure improvements, Amtrak Gold Runner Service will operate with the following modified service:</p>
<h3>Southbound Service</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Trains 702</b> and <b>704</b>, which normally operate between Sacramento (SAC) and Bakersfield (BFD), will terminate in Fresno (FNO). <b>Buses 4302 </b>and <b>4304</b> will provide alternate transportation between Fresno (FNO) and Bakersfield (BFD) with an intermediate stop at Hanford (HNF).</li>
<li><b>Trains 710</b>, <b>712</b>, <b>714</b> and <b>716</b>, which normally operate between Oakland (OKJ) and Bakersfield (BFD), will terminate in Fresno (FNO). <b>Buses 4310</b>, <b>4312</b>, <b>4314</b> and <b>4316</b> will provide alternate transportation between Fresno (FNO) and Bakersfield (BFD) with an intermediate stop at Hanford (HNF).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Northbound Service</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Train 703</b>, which normally operates between Bakersfield (BFD) and Sacramento (SAC), will originate in Fresno (FNO). <b>Bus 4303 </b>will provide alternate transportation between Bakersfield (BFD) and Fresno (FNO) with an intermediate stop at Hanford (HNF).</li>
<li><b>Trains 713</b>, <b>715</b>, <b>717</b> and <b>719</b>, which normally operate between Bakersfield (BFD) and Oakland (OKJ), will originate in Fresno (FNO). <b>Buses 4313</b>, <b>4315</b>, <b>4317</b> and <b>4319</b> will provide alternate transportation between Bakersfield (BFD) and Fresno (FNO) with an intermediate stop at Hanford (HNF).</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p>No alternate service will be provided at Corcoran (COC) or Wasco (WAC).<br />
</p>
<p> </p>
<p>PSN 1026-89</p>

	    </div>
	</div>
	
	

</div>



    
	
	

